  SKIPPED, checker-enforced. `checkBlocks` compares the ZWSP count of the translation with the Korean source and FAILS on a
  mismatch. The counts are already identical (003 52/52, 005 8/8, 006 4/4, 008 10/10, 009 5/5, 013 5/5, 015 3/3), so removing
  them would turn the file red. Part a's own reviewer reaches the same conclusion ("identical in the German file, so it is a
  pipeline artefact … strip the zero-width spaces in the pipeline, not in the Greek"). Needs a pipeline/source fix, not a
  Greek-lane fix.
- b33 — 018 §4 label «Τα ανωτέρω είναι συμβουλή για τον σχεδιασμό της σύμβασης».
  SKIPPED on the reviewer's own instruction ("no Greek change until the English is corrected"): the English source carries the
  same false label, and changing only the Greek would break source parity. Belongs to the English editor.


